- Update the vendored openssl and openssl-sys crates, for OpenSSL 4 in
  Fedora 45

* Sat Oct 31 2026 Martin Rixham <martin.rixham@gmail.com> - 1.1.0-1
- Initial package
- Run aria2 RPC on loopback only, with a per-run secret token
